{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Bespoke Curl Type & Wave Definition Guide (P06)
  Tailored specifically for Botanical Curl Defining Styling Cream (100ml)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-editorial-section zvhc-curl-guide-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: var(--zvhc-t01-bg, #FAF6F8); border-top: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: var(--zvhc-t01-pill-bg, #F8E4EB); color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 9999px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <span>✦ CURL PATTERN COMPATIBILITY</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Engineered for Type 2A Waves to 4C Coils</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
        Unlike heavy petrolatum-based creams that weigh down fine waves or thin gels that leave coarse coils brittle, our lightweight botanical emulsion provides flexible cast memory, instant cuticle slip, and frizz-free definition across all curl textures.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
      <!-- Type 2: Wavy -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 28px 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); margin-bottom: 4px;">Type 2A – 2C</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Loose Waves & S-Patterns</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Apply 1 pump to soaking wet lengths. Use praying hands method and scrunch upward toward roots. Air dry or diffuse on low heat for soft, bouncy wave clumps without greasy buildup.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E);">Recommended Dose: 1 Pump</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 3: Curly -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 28px 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); margin-bottom: 4px;">Type 3A – 3C</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Spring Spirals & Corkscrews</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Section damp hair into 4 quadrants. Rake 1–2 pumps per section from mid-lengths to ends, then gently shake curls to form natural ringlets. Diffuse to 80% dry to lock volume and spiral memory.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E);">Recommended Dose: 1–2 Pumps per Section</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 4: Coily -->
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card" style="padding: 28px 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
        <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); margin-bottom: 4px;">Type 4A – 4C</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Tight Coils & Z-Patterns</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Use as your styling cream step in the L.O.C. (Liquid-Oil-Cream) routine. Smooth generously over wet sections, twirl around fingers or use a defining brush for maximum elongation and 72-hour moisture seal.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E);">Recommended Dose: 2 Pumps + Layer with Batana Oil</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

